{"id":"c989c60a7c30291e","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-banach-mazur.md","title":"Banach–Mazur：I 的胜策与 comeager","display":"thm-banach-mazur — Banach–Mazur：I 的胜策与 comeager","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-banach-mazur","aliases":["20-thm-banach-mazur"],"display":"thm-banach-mazur — Banach–Mazur：I 的胜策与 comeager","chapter":"14","section":"14.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 14.1.3 的第一个等价式；原书省略逆向的本地补证","source_pdf_pages":[242],"source_printed_pages":[213],"depends_on":["[[20-df-bm-game]]","[[20-df-category]]","[[20-df-bm-strategy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-banach-mazur"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-banach-mazur</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-banach-mazur — Banach–Mazur：I 的胜策与 comeager"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 14.1.3 的第一个等价式；原书省略逆向的本地补证"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>242</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f02918e259cd9a8e\" href=\"?note=f02918e259cd9a8e\" title=\"20-df-bm-game\">20-df-bm-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbd3c82cd2473f13\" href=\"?note=dbd3c82cd2473f13\" title=\"20-df-bm-strategy\">20-df-bm-strategy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；采用 I 首步固定为空、II 选择首个非空柱集的 BM 博弈。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f02918e259cd9a8e\" href=\"?note=f02918e259cd9a8e\" title=\"20-df-bm-game\">20-df-bm-game</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbd3c82cd2473f13\" href=\"?note=dbd3c82cd2473f13\" title=\"20-df-bm-strategy\">20-df-bm-strategy</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,I}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,I}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从 comeager 到胜策：取稠密开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 的交落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次轮到 I 时，把 II 刚出的串严格延伸到整个柱位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 的串。最终点属于全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span>，因而获胜。</p>\n<p>反向需保证各阶段历史能一致拼接，不能只取所有可达柱的并。固定 I 胜策。一个记录到 I 刚应答的有限历史 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>，末串为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span>；令下一次 II 任意出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\succ\\eta\">\\(\\tau\\succ\\eta\\)</span>，I 再按策略应答，所得响应柱在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\eta]\">\\([\\eta]\\)</span> 内形成稠密的柱族。第一层也这样做，只把初始末串看为空。每层在每个父柱中从响应柱族贪心取一个极大两两不交子族，并保留对应历史：柱族可数，可按代码依次加入与已选柱不交的候选。</p>\n<p>所得子族的并在父柱中稠密：若有开柱与全部已选柱不交，响应族的稠密性给一个包含于该开柱的响应候选；它与全部所选候选不交，枚举到时理应被选，矛盾。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n\">\\(D_n\\)</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层选中柱的并。各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n\">\\(D_n\\)</span> 全局稠密开，且下一层细化上一层。任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\bigcap_nD_n\">\\(X\\in\\bigcap_nD_n\\)</span> 在每层属于唯一一个选中柱，其所附历史逐层延长；响应串严格增长，故拼成一条遵循原策略、结果恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的对局。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcap_nD_n\\subseteq A\">\\(\\bigcap_nD_n\\subseteq A\\)</span>，证明 comeager。</p>\n<p>原书后手括号等价式已由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"19c8ea5f8ad3f6d0\" href=\"?note=19c8ea5f8ad3f6d0\" title=\"20-thm-bm-second-local-category\">20-thm-bm-second-local-category</a> 按首步约定订正；这里不将纯导航链接反列为上游依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 213 / PDF 242；逆向证明为本地补写。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-bm-game","status":"resolved","id":"f02918e259cd9a8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-bm-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bm-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"dbd3c82cd2473f13","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-bm-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bm-game","status":"resolved","id":"f02918e259cd9a8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bm-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"dbd3c82cd2473f13","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-bm-second-local-category","status":"resolved","id":"19c8ea5f8ad3f6d0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书后手括号等价式已由 [[20-thm-bm-second-local-category]] 按首步约定订正；这里不将纯导航链接反列为上游依赖。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,I}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\succ\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"[\\eta]","display":false},{"tex":"D_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"D_n","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\bigcap_nD_n","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcap_nD_n\\subseteq A","display":false}],"bytes":2472,"backlinks":[{"id":"19c8ea5f8ad3f6d0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-relative-category]]；see [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-banach-mazur]] — 章 14；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-banach-mazur]]"}],"outgoing":["f02918e